{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781405638021,"sessionID":"ses_13bf37d61ffew9URw7N5lef1Wr","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_sveUtTiUKidqp2hRjw11iXXc","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/00_intake_brief.md","offset":1,"limit":400},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/00_intake_brief.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Intake Brief\n2: \n3: Date: 2026-05-09\n4: \n5: The first-wave medication cooler rollout needs a short recommendation packet for the operations coordinator. The packet should select exactly three North-region clinics that can receive cooler kits before the June launch window.\n6: \n7: Keep this continuity fact with the final recommendation: Maple Junction Clinic is the donor continuity anchor if it remains eligible, and its donor continuity code is `MJ-14`. The code was printed on already-approved training inserts and is not repeated in the later operations files.\n8: \n9: The launch window is 2026-06-10 through 2026-06-14. All selected clinics need coordinator coverage for the full window and delivery no later than 2026-06-07.\n10: \n11: Do not include a separate narrative for future-wave clinic requests unless they change current first-wave eligibility.\n\n(End of file - total 11 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Intake Brief\n\nDate: 2026-05-09\n\nThe first-wave medication cooler rollout needs a short recommendation packet for the operations coordinator. The packet should select exactly three North-region clinics that can receive cooler kits before the June launch window.\n\nKeep this continuity fact with the final recommendation: Maple Junction Clinic is the donor continuity anchor if it remains eligible, and its donor continuity code is `MJ-14`. The code was printed on already-approved training inserts and is not repeated in the later operations files.\n\nThe launch window is 2026-06-10 through 2026-06-14. All selected clinics need coordinator coverage for the full window and delivery no later than 2026-06-07.\n\nDo not include a separate narrative for future-wave clinic requests unless they change current first-wave eligibility.","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/00_intake_brief.md","time":{"start":1781405637910,"end":1781405637999}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_06da4d45f27d92b4016a2e17c5d5188191b8519c16066ec841"}},"id":"prt_ec40cdd13001leq2jm4Gbrlz0d","sessionID":"ses_13bf37d61ffew9URw7N5lef1Wr","messageID":"msg_ec40ca8aa001O9BpOnVccpEcPZ"}}
