{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781405694042,"sessionID":"ses_13bf37d61ffew9URw7N5lef1Wr","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_xfPntJ4vJ8ynKAl5LIuMQKks","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/clinic_screen.md","offset":1,"limit":300},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/clinic_screen.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: ## First-Wave Budget\n2: \n3: - Budget: `$20,000`\n4: - Cost formula: `setup_cost` from `02_site_roster.csv` + `transport_cost` from `06_transport_quotes.csv`\n5: \n6: ## Clinic Screening Checkpoint\n7: \n8: | Clinic ID | Clinic Name | Effective Storage Status | Coordinator Full Window | Transport Delivery Date | Total Rollout Cost | Eligible | Blocking Reason |\n9: | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: | --- | --- |\n10: | N-101 | Maple Junction Clinic | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-06 | $7,400 | yes | None |\n11: | N-102 | Riverbend Health | `certified after mitigation complete` | yes | 2026-06-07 | $6,450 | yes | None |\n12: | N-103 | Pine Ridge Outreach | `certified` | no | 2026-06-05 | $5,500 | no | Coordinator unavailable for the full launch window due to 2026-06-12 blackout. |\n13: | N-104 | Lakeside Family Care | `suspended` | yes | 2026-06-06 | $5,350 | no | Effective storage status `suspended` is not accepted for first-wave use. |\n14: | N-105 | Cedar Works Clinic | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-08 | $4,100 | no | Clinic status is `closed maintenance`; delivery also misses the 2026-06-07 cutoff. |\n15: | N-106 | Hillcrest Annex | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-07 | $4,950 | yes | None |\n16: | N-107 | Old Mill Clinic | `conditional pass pending` | yes | 2026-06-05 | $4,100 | no | Effective storage status `conditional pass pending` is not accepted for first-wave use. |\n17: | S-201 | South Gate Clinic | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-05 | $4,400 | no | Region is `South`, but first-wave selection is limited to `North` clinics. |\n18: \n19: ## Selected-Clinic Total Cost Calculation\n20: \n21: - Maple Junction Clinic: `$6,200 + $1,200 = $7,400`\n22: - Riverbend Health: `$5,500 + $950 = $6,450`\n23: - Hillcrest Annex: `$4,100 + $850 = $4,950`\n24: - Selected-clinic total: `$7,400 + $6,450 + $4,950 = $18,800`\n25: \n26: Only three clinics meet all hard first-wave requirements, so all three eligible clinics are selected.\n\n(End of file - total 26 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"## First-Wave Budget\n\n- Budget: `$20,000`\n- Cost formula: `setup_cost` from `02_site_roster.csv` + `transport_cost` from `06_transport_quotes.csv`\n\n## Clinic Screening Checkpoint\n\n| Clinic ID | Clinic Name | Effective Storage Status | Coordinator Full Window | Transport Delivery Date | Total Rollout Cost | Eligible | Blocking Reason |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: | --- | --- |\n| N-101 | Maple Junction Clinic | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-06 | $7,400 | yes | None |\n| N-102 | Riverbend Health | `certified after mitigation complete` | yes | 2026-06-07 | $6,450 | yes | None |\n| N-103 | Pine Ridge Outreach | `certified` | no | 2026-06-05 | $5,500 | no | Coordinator unavailable for the full launch window due to 2026-06-12 blackout. |\n| N-104 | Lakeside Family Care | `suspended` | yes | 2026-06-06 | $5,350 | no | Effective storage status `suspended` is not accepted for first-wave use. |\n| N-105 | Cedar Works Clinic | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-08 | $4,100 | no | Clinic status is `closed maintenance`; delivery also misses the 2026-06-07 cutoff. |\n| N-106 | Hillcrest Annex | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-07 | $4,950 | yes | None |\n| N-107 | Old Mill Clinic | `conditional pass pending` | yes | 2026-06-05 | $4,100 | no | Effective storage status `conditional pass pending` is not accepted for first-wave use. |\n| S-201 | South Gate Clinic | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-05 | $4,400 | no | Region is `South`, but first-wave selection is limited to `North` clinics. |\n\n## Selected-Clinic Total Cost Calculation\n","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/clinic_screen.md","time":{"start":1781405694001,"end":1781405694041}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_01394192acc9718c016a2e17fc339c819199c808eb66011430"}},"id":"prt_ec40db81f001iRoo0y1t86MVET","sessionID":"ses_13bf37d61ffew9URw7N5lef1Wr","messageID":"msg_ec40d9d4d001HwDmAM3PFlp9q1"}}
